# Accepted records in the base image's own pip, kept deliberately so
# derived images can install their dependencies. These are pip's *vendored
# internal copies* (pip/_vendor), not packages the image exposes; current
# pip (26.x) still bundles them, so there is no upgrade to apply. Remove
# these entries when a pip release rolls the vendored copies forward.
